OpenCPN 5.14.2 for AmigaOS 3: network parts this build leaves out for now: no curl (the mDNS peer check and the send-to-peer dialogs build without it), no Signal K (IXWebSocket), and the REST server without its mongoose io thread. NMEA over TCP/UDP stays in.

